### Registrar un usuario
POST http://localhost:5008/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leandro",
  "email": "test@correo.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Iniciar sesión
POST http://localhost:5008/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@correo.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Usuario autenticado actual
GET http://localhost:5008/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:5008/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Perfil actual
GET http://localhost:5008/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar perfil
PATCH http://localhost:5008/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Leandro Atmos"
}

### Cambiar password
PATCH http://localhost:5008/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "12345678"
}

### Obtener favoritos
GET http://localhost:5008/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear favorito
POST http://localhost:5008/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buenos Aires",
  "country": "Argentina",
  "lat": -34.61315,
  "lon": -58.37723
}

### Reordenar favoritos
PATCH http://localhost:5008/favorites/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "favoriteIds": ["1", "2"]
}

### Preferencias
GET http://localhost:5008/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar preferencias
PATCH http://localhost:5008/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tempUnit": "celsius",
  "windUnit": "kmh",
  "language": "es",
  "timeFormat": "24h",
  "updateInterval": 30,
  "pushNotifications": false,
  "autoUpdate": true,
  "offlineMode": false
}

### Historial de búsqueda
GET http://localhost:5008/search-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear entrada de historial
POST http://localhost:5008/search-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cordoba",
  "country": "Argentina",
  "lat": -31.4135,
  "lon": -64.18105
}

### Buscar ciudades
GET http://localhost:5008/cities/search?q=berlin

### Clima actual
GET http://localhost:5008/weather/current?lat=-34.61315&lon=-58.37723

### Pronóstico
GET http://localhost:5008/weather/forecast?lat=-34.61315&lon=-58.37723
